---
import { ArrowRight, ShieldAlert, CheckCircle } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="hero" class="relative pt-12 pb-24 md:pt-20 md:pb-32 overflow-hidden">
  {/* Radial Ambient Glow Background */}
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[350px] bg-indigo-600/15 dark:bg-indigo-600/20 blur-[130px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10" />
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-10 w-[350px] h-[250px] bg-cyan-500/10 blur-[110px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10" />

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
      {/* Status Chip */}
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 dark:bg-indigo-500/15 border border-indigo-500/30 text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-indigo-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-indigo-500"></span>
        </span>
        <span>Lead Full-Stack Architect &bull; Agentic AI Specialist</span>
      </div>

      {/* Main Headline */}
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-[1.1]">
        Transforming Brittle AI Loops Into <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 via-cyan-400 to-emerald-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Deterministic Enterprise Workflows</span>.
      </h1>

      {/* Modern Problem & Solution Narrative */}
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Modern generative AI promises autonomy, but raw LLMs deployed into production quickly degrade into
        <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white"> token burn</strong>,
        <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white"> context drift</strong>, and
        <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white"> non-deterministic failure loops</strong>.
        I architect observable, cost-effective full-stack platforms and state-machine-driven agent systems that deliver deterministic outcomes at scale.
      </p>

      {/* Action Buttons */}
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-4">
        <button
          onclick="window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('open-resume-modal'))"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-indigo-700 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-indigo-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0"
        >
          <span>Request Official Resume</span>
          <ArrowRight className="w-4 h-4" />
        </button>

        <a
          href="#projects"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition"
        >
          <span>Explore Architecture Deep Dives</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Modern Contrast Grid: The Industry Problem vs Architectural Reality */}
    <div class="mt-16 sm:mt-24 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      {/* Problem Card */}
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-500/20 bg-red-950/10 dark:bg-[#120e14] p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-sm relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
            <ShieldAlert className="w-5 h-5" />
          </span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">The Industry Bottleneck</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-red-400 font-mono">Uncontrolled Agent Autonomy</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold mt-0.5">&times;</span>
            <span><strong>Unbounded Token Burn:</strong> Unchecked prompts and massive history dumps inflate inference budgets without improving reasoning.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold mt-0.5">&times;</span>
            <span><strong>Context Drift & Hallucination:</strong> Agents forget core constraints after multi-turn tool calling, injecting subtle bugs into codebases.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold mt-0.5">&times;</span>
            <span><strong>Brittle Feedback Loops:</strong> Agents hallucinating CLI outputs or spinning in circles without deterministic exit criteria.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Solution Card */}
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/25 bg-emerald-950/10 dark:bg-[#0c161a] p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-sm relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
            <CheckCircle className="w-5 h-5" />
          </span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">My Architectural Approach</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-mono">Observable & Deterministic Systems</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-0.5">&check;</span>
            <span><strong>Strict State Machine Boundaries:</strong> Deterministic transitions, typed schema gates (Zod), and sandboxed execution environments.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-0.5">&check;</span>
            <span><strong>Context Token Optimization:</strong> Surgical file-level slicing, smart `.aiignore` filters, and aggressive prompt caching.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-0.5">&check;</span>
            <span><strong>Automated TDD & Verifiable CI/CD:</strong> Self-healing regression test suites and containerized delivery pipelines (Docker + Caddy).</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
